{
  "description": "观察课件页面的实际呈现，按回执source、identity、coverage判断载体和范围。需要局部画面时传clip:{x,y,width,height}，单位为原预览viewport的CSS像素；clip只裁PNG并筛选相交控件，structure仍为整viewport可见文字。回执coverage说明裁剪与PNG比例，elements仍用原坐标，原图保留为originalImage资源。隔离Published观察在同一任务、文档版本内保留正常播放器和程序运行状态，并返回可操作elements/handle；用view.click/input操作最近句柄，再看实际结果。换页继续观察对应工程路径，沿同一会话保留实验记录；源码变化后重新观察会重建该版本会话。工程文件使用project.list返回的页面或对象path；多课件用project指明，也可用已授权target。观察及输入不改作者工程、用户选区或现场播放器，不证明另一导出路径性能。purpose默认required；自行添加的可选诊断可用diagnostic，诊断不可用仍保留未验证说明，不表示通过。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$defs": {
      "__schema0": {
        "enum": [
          "auto",
          "low",
          "high"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "__schema1": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "height": {
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
            "type": "number"
          },
          "width": {
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
            "type": "number"
          },
          "x": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "y": {
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "x",
          "y",
          "width",
          "height"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "__schema2": {
        "enum": [
          "required",
          "diagnostic"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "anyOf": [
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "clip": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
          },
          "detail": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
          },
          "purpose": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2"
          },
          "target": {
            "maxLength": 200,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "target"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "clip": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
          },
          "detail": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
          },
          "path": {
            "maxLength": 500,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "project": {
            "maxLength": 1000,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "purpose": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "path"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "read",
    "label": "查看页面",
    "targetKinds": [
      "course-surface",
      "course-instance",
      "course-location",
      "course-owner",
      "course-state",
      "course-object",
      "document"
    ]
  },
  "name": "view.observe",
  "version": 1
}
